const govtRoutes = [
  {
    body: 'DBT and its autonomous institutes (NII, NCCS, ICGEB, InStem, RCB, and others) run their own scientist recruitment through individual advertisements year-round. This is the one route where the hidden barrier matters: entry Staff Scientist and Scientist-B posts here are usually gated by a completed PhD, or by a Master\'s plus several years of documented research experience — so it is rarely a straight-out-of-MSc door. Build the JRF-to-PhD track above first if this is your real target.',
